---
---

<div class="cookie-banner" id="cookie-banner" hidden>
	<div class="cookie-banner-inner">
		<p class="cookie-banner-text">
			Utilitzem cookies pròpies (necessàries per al funcionament del lloc) i, si ho acceptes,
			cookies d'estadístiques (Google Analytics) per entendre com es fa servir la web. Pots
			acceptar-les totes, rebutjar-les o personalitzar-ne l'ús. Més informació a la
			<a href="/politica-cookies">política de cookies</a>.
		</p>
		<div class="cookie-banner-actions">
			<button type="button" class="cookie-btn cookie-btn-ghost" id="cookie-customize">
				Personalitzar
			</button>
			<button type="button" class="cookie-btn cookie-btn-outline" id="cookie-reject">
				Rebutjar
			</button>
			<button type="button" class="cookie-btn cookie-btn-primary" id="cookie-accept">
				Acceptar totes
			</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<div class="cookie-modal" id="cookie-modal" hidden>
	<div class="cookie-modal-backdrop" id="cookie-modal-backdrop"></div>
	<div class="cookie-modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cookie-modal-title">
		<h2 id="cookie-modal-title">Configuració de cookies</h2>

		<div class="cookie-category">
			<div class="cookie-category-header">
				<span class="cookie-category-name">Funcional</span>
				<input type="checkbox" checked disabled aria-label="Funcional (sempre activa)" />
			</div>
			<p>Necessàries perquè el lloc funcioni correctament. Sempre actives.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="cookie-category">
			<div class="cookie-category-header">
				<span class="cookie-category-name">Preferències</span>
				<input type="checkbox" id="cookie-cat-preferencies" aria-label="Preferències" />
			</div>
			<p>Recorden opcions de la teva visita (com l'idioma triat).</p>
		</div>

		<div class="cookie-category">
			<div class="cookie-category-header">
				<span class="cookie-category-name">Estadístiques</span>
				<input type="checkbox" id="cookie-cat-estadistiques" aria-label="Estadístiques" />
			</div>
			<p>Google Analytics: ens ajuden a entendre com es fa servir la web, de forma anònima.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="cookie-category">
			<div class="cookie-category-header">
				<span class="cookie-category-name">Màrqueting</span>
				<input type="checkbox" id="cookie-cat-marketing" aria-label="Màrqueting" />
			</div>
			<p>Actualment no fem servir cap cookie de màrqueting. Deixem la categoria preparada per si
				en el futur s'afegeix publicitat o remarketing.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="cookie-modal-actions">
			<button type="button" class="cookie-btn cookie-btn-outline" id="cookie-modal-close">
				Cancel·lar
			</button>
			<button type="button" class="cookie-btn cookie-btn-primary" id="cookie-modal-save">
				Desar preferències
			</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<script>
	import { mountCookieBanner } from '../lib/consent';
	mountCookieBanner();
</script>

<style>
	/* Tokens del banner: único punto de personalización por proyecto. Redefine estos 6
	   custom properties (o los --color-*/--font-sans de los que heredan por defecto) para
	   adaptar colores y tipografía sin tocar el resto del componente. */
	.cookie-banner,
	.cookie-modal {
		--cookie-font: var(--font-sans, system-ui, sans-serif);
		--cookie-surface-dark: var(--color-navy-dark, #1a1a1a);
		--cookie-surface-light: #fff;
		--cookie-text-on-dark: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		--cookie-accent: var(--color-accent-gold, #e8b84b);
		--cookie-accent-text: var(--color-navy-dark, #1a1a1a);
		--cookie-radius: 999px;
	}

	.cookie-banner {
		position: fixed;
		inset: auto 0 0 0;
		z-index: 1000;
		background-color: var(--cookie-surface-dark);
		color: var(--cookie-text-on-dark);
		box-shadow: 0 -4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
		font-family: var(--cookie-font);
	}

	.cookie-banner-inner {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.cookie-banner-text {
		flex: 1 1 320px;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: var(--cookie-text-on-dark);
	}

	.cookie-banner-text a {
		color: var(--cookie-surface-light);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.cookie-banner-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.6rem;
	}

	.cookie-btn {
		font-family: var(--cookie-font);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		border-radius: var(--cookie-radius);
		padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
		cursor: pointer;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.cookie-btn-primary {
		background-color: var(--cookie-accent);
		color: var(--cookie-accent-text);
	}

	.cookie-btn-outline {
		background-color: transparent;
		border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
		color: var(--cookie-surface-light);
	}

	.cookie-btn-ghost {
		background-color: transparent;
		border: none;
		color: var(--cookie-text-on-dark);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.cookie-modal {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 1100;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		font-family: var(--cookie-font);
	}

	.cookie-modal-backdrop {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background-color: rgba(3, 27, 50, 0.6);
	}

	.cookie-modal-panel {
		position: relative;
		background-color: var(--cookie-surface-light);
		color: var(--color-navy, #1a1a1a);
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 2rem;
		max-width: 480px;
		width: calc(100% - 2rem);
		max-height: calc(100vh - 3rem);
		overflow-y: auto;
	}

	.cookie-modal-panel h2 {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.cookie-category {
		padding: 0.9rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-gray-light, #e6e8ea);
	}

	.cookie-category:first-of-type {
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-gray-light, #e6e8ea);
	}

	.cookie-category-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.cookie-category p {
		margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: var(--color-gray-mid, #666);
	}

	.cookie-modal-actions {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.cookie-banner-inner {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: stretch;
		}

		.cookie-banner-actions {
			justify-content: stretch;
		}

		.cookie-btn {
			flex: 1;
			text-align: center;
		}
	}
</style>
